*** Settings ***
Documentation       Generic checks of test data - these keywords are used in tests.
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/interactions/faker_interactions.resource


*** Keywords ***
All Fields Should Be Filled
    [Documentation]    Checks that every field of a record (dictionary) has a value.
    [Arguments]    ${record}
    FOR    ${field}    ${value}    IN    &{record}
        ${text}    Convert To String    ${value}
        Should Not Be Empty    ${text}    Field "${field}" is empty
    END

Email Address Should Be Valid
    [Documentation]    Checks that a value is built like an e-mail address.
    [Arguments]    ${email}
    Should Match Regexp    ${email}    ^\\S+@\\S+\\.\\S+$

Values Should Be Unique
    [Documentation]    Checks that no value occurs twice in the list.
    [Arguments]    ${values}
    List Should Not Contain Duplicates    ${values}
